 L('Saints are our friends','Saints followed Jesus well. They are in heaven and pray for us. We learn from their lives.','828,957','Hebrews 12:1','saint communion-of-saints','Which saint would you like to meet?','Read a short story of a saint (Francis, Thérèse, or Patrick). Draw a favorite scene.','guardian-angel'),
